    <guid isPermaLink="false">6afdb837a4a79edf137b5a87</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:42:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>打扫卫生的时候一时兴起录了这集节目！</span></p><p><span>以前有朋友说我播客的BGM很好听，所以就整理了一个☁️网易云歌单：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=18610551839&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX18On25Hi/czCByOoWKyc8pQjwbalLZV+K4=" data-url="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=18610551839&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX18On25Hi/czCByOoWKyc8pQjwbalLZV+K4="><strong><span>去大理走小路BGM</span></strong></a></p><p><span>整理的时候，又发现这档播客还有这么多“遗珠”，所以就录了几段音频来介绍这些宝藏内容。</span></p><p><span>这是一集 </span><strong><em><span>听歌 </span></em></strong><span>内容，对于听众来说算是 </span><strong><em><span>捡漏</span></em></strong><span>，对于我来说是在体力劳动过程中的 </span><strong><em><span>摸鱼</span></em></strong><span>，对于这档节目来说又是一次 </span><strong><em><span>走岔路</span></em></strong><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>Timeline：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 一次回顾，关于什么是“走小路”</span></p><h2><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699a999266e2c30377fe9332" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699a999266e2c30377fe9332"><span>Vol.100 我为什么还在做播客？</span></a></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 关于大理的在地化内容</span></p><h2><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69bc12452d318777c9c3ea21" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69bc12452d318777c9c3ea21"><span>Vol.104 🌱春天，可以在大理做的10件小事 | 大理边角料</span></a></h2><h2><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69cfb045e2c8be31554f82cd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69cfb045e2c8be31554f82cd"><span>Vol.106 租房指南：大理旅居爽，我该住哪里？</span></a></h2><h2><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f211f8fbed7ba9411fe2bc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f211f8fbed7ba9411fe2bc"><span>Vol.110 大理三月街：一年一度购物狂欢节，千年传承与时代阵痛。</span></a></h2><h2><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2c20e143a22a695582c93d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2c20e143a22a695582c93d"><span>Vol.115 锐评&amp;安利：雨天大理，顶级浪漫？？？</span></a></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 单口碎碎念：“一个书店老板的理想与现实、乐观与挣扎”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1369">22:49</a> 三文笔村声音地图</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69627b5fe235ea65bc29947f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69627b5fe235ea65bc29947f"><span>Vol.95 三文笔村漫步：从一块石头到新大理人。</span></a></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkr-uf9Y90Gv4RqJBFQ6cVgM833Q.PNG"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 大理风物志</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ac60e4c8cdeb38c25b4941" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ac60e4c8cdeb38c25b4941"><span>Vol.102 看得见的白族女性：脚下有土地，心中有底气。</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69db8640e2c8be3155016a8f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69db8640e2c8be3155016a8f"><span>Vol.107 大理历史：苍洱地区万年往事和十多个曾用名。</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1b027c7460cabdeb58677a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1b027c7460cabdeb58677a"><span>Vol.113 甲马：从祈福用品到情绪文创的民间智慧。</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a3770c8608f69578bd7629f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a3770c8608f69578bd7629f"><span>Vol.116 学好白族话，走遍大理都不怕。</span></a></p><h2><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6abf77f8195d838e2aeca286" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6abf77f8195d838e2aeca286"><span>Vol.123 白族民居：大理的老房子，为什么这么有“活人感”？</span></a></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 在大理读书</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e8dc191e94ae6921e8f0be" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e8dc191e94ae6921e8f0be"><span>Vol.109 音乐和文学，一个都不能少 | 歌不鸽 : 423世界读书日特别节目</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2582d27444b5722234e85a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2582d27444b5722234e85a"><span>Vol.114 “老板，推荐几本和大理有关的书呗？”</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a58f0c2016dcc7e05435052" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a58f0c2016dcc7e05435052"><span>Vol.119 且慢！吃菌子前先读书，心里有数不迷糊~</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a9063751352af56ff3d245a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a9063751352af56ff3d245a"><span>Vol.121 大理是马孔多的10个理由 |《百年孤独》</span></a></p><p><span>🎵 本集BGM:</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">02:41</a> Victor Mechanick - Start over</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a> Lou Donaldson - Blues Walk</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">11:02</a> Still Corners - The Trip</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a> Richard Cheese - People = Shit</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a> Casino Demon - Good Morning</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1559">25:59</a> The Shanghai Restoration Project,张乐 - Listen</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1836">30:36</a> bing crosby and the andrews sisters - Life Is So Peculiar</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2044">34:04</a> Kings of Convenience - Brave New World</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2202">36:42</a> 坂本龍一 - Risky</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2451">40:51</a> 戏班 - 四季歌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2933">48:53</a> 小河与寻谣计划 - 轻轻行 Walk Softly</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
