  <item>
    <title>Vol.124 我是羞于承认理想吗?(三个月没更新的漫长单口碎碎念:）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6acf49bbe742e36efcc2e053</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6acf49bbe742e36efcc2e053</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 09:27:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>三个月没有更新单口碎碎念了，一次回顾7/8/9所思所想所经历的节目。从大理搬到昆明的这三个月像是一次夏令营，仿佛从我琐碎的日常生活中gap了一段时间。下个月又要回到大理啦~具体内容听节目吧！</span></p><p><span>这期节目的尾声临时加了一点当天发生的事情，算是对过去某个心结的告别吧 :)</span></p><p><span>收听愉快！秋天愉快~</span></p><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><p><strong><span>7月</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a> 城市生活依然让人无处遁形</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="367">06:07</a> 和妈妈相处，越来越像室友</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 工作很快进入了舒适圈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">13:37</a> 我对曾经深以为然的职场叙事产生了怀疑</span></p><p><strong><span>8月</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 你会因为可以报销就产生超出自己日常的消费吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1377">22:57</a> 女性在职场依然太被动了…</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> AI焦虑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">29:44</a> 在扮演一个角色和做自己之间如何平衡呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2104">35:04</a> 我的书店小路书屋出现困局</span></p><p><strong><span>9月</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2544">42:24</a> 云喃默（器乐音乐节）太好了！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkdZmXSh2XiDmJT5P284EBlsI5Fz.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2746">45:46</a> 告别璞玉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3132">52:12</a> 天降NPC跟我杠上了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3700">1:01:40</a> 这集节目的标题：我是羞于承认理想吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4375">1:12:55</a> 今日突发：我的青春销毁了。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqCze7gmBT_NoA3HCUuqngm0W8no.jpg"><p></p><p><span>🎵本集BGM:</span></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 浅水ShallowEnd - 请柬 (Your Wedding)</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> Amadou &amp; Mariam - Sabali</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> Children make choice - INFJ</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2632">43:52</a> The Shanghai Restoration Project,张乐 - Listen</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3011">50:11</a> Richard Cheese - People = Shit</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3648">1:00:48</a> The Screen Tones - Stay Alone</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4092">1:08:12</a> 简希声 - 泪雨</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4880">1:21:20</a> The Libertines - Songs They Never Play On The Radio</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>📷 本集封面：半夜陪我录播客的酱油哥</span></p>]]></description>
