  <item>
    <title>Vol.120 文化是个圈：15个书店/文化品牌小盘点。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a77528b000a55a9bb04eadc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a77528b000a55a9bb04eadc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 16:16:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>*友情提醒：这是一集和大理没什么关系的播客~</span></em></p><p><span>在我经营近四年大理三文笔村的小路书屋之后，难免陷入卡顿迷茫。于是在今年夏天，我入职了一个更大规模的书店，想试试自己在这个行业里能潜到多深。</span></p><p><span>果然！“格局”一下子就打开了~</span></p><p><span>这集节目里，我大致梳理了自己感兴趣的15个书店/文化品牌的特点、现状、发展脉络。</span></p><p><span>欢迎批评指正，也非常期待同行讨论👏🏻</span></p><p></p><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><p><strong><span>「复合型文化生态品牌」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 理想国（含naive理想国）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 单向空间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 中信书店</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">18:16</a> 新华文轩（含文轩books）</span></p><p><strong><span>「老牌独立书店」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 晓风书屋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> 万圣书园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 先锋书店</span></p><p><strong><span>「连锁大品牌书店」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">27:35</a> 诚品书店</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1718">28:38</a> 西西弗书店</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">29:23</a> 方所</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 覔书店</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> 茑屋书店</span></p><p><strong><span>「其他文化品牌」</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2084">34:44</a> 阿那亚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 做書</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a> 多抓鱼</span></p><p></p><p><span>🎵本集BGM：Jack Jezzro - Santa Lucia (Romance In Venice Album Version)</span></p>]]></description>
